<title>UK: Eadie sees '96 results missing estimates.</title>
<headline>Eadie sees '96 results missing estimates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British healthcare equipment maker Eadie Holdings Plc said on Wednesday it expected its 1996 results to fall significantly short of market expectations.</p>
<p>The company, which previously warned the market about earnings, also said it no longer expected to pay a final dividend on its shares.</p>
</text>
